%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a0f9465ab7696142ac3a15a37af66c2, type: 3}
  m_Name: Evelyn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterId: char_evelyn
  displayName: Evelyn
  profilePicture: {fileID: 0}
  contactButton: {fileID: 0}
  scheduledMessages:
  - messageId: Opening_Message
    triggerHour: 20
    triggerMinute: 41
    requiredClues: []
    grantedClues: []
    messages:
    - sender: 1
      text: Thank you for agreeing to take the case on such short notice. I'm terribly
        sorry for asking this of you on New Year's Eve but... I didn't know who else
        to ask.
      delay: 0
    - sender: 1
      text: I have sent your details to all of the party guests, I have asked them
        to contact you to make a brief introduction, so you should be getting those
        shortly.
      delay: 3.2
    - sender: 1
      text: Once you are confident that you have found out who Count Backward is-
        call me, and I will ask that guest to leave. And please, I beg you to tell
        me before midnight, I don't want to find out if the legend is true, Good
        luck.
      delay: 1.1
  - messageId: more_information
    triggerHour: 22
    triggerMinute: 0
    requiredClues: []
    grantedClues:
    - 10_more_information
    messages:
    - sender: 1
      text: Do you need any more information on any of the guests?
      delay: 3.2
  - messageId: evelyn_on_the_bang
    triggerHour: 22
    triggerMinute: 35
    requiredClues: []
    grantedClues:
    - the_big_bang
    messages:
    - sender: 1
      text: We have just heard a loud crashing sound from upstairs! Richard had just
        been asking us about the missing pocket watch when we heard the noise.
      delay: 0
    - sender: 1
      text: Also, Bryan seemed to mutter something to himself...
      delay: 2.1
  - messageId: evelyns_reminder
    triggerHour: 23
    triggerMinute: 42
    requiredClues: []
    grantedClues: []
    messages:
    - sender: 1
      text: Remember to call telling me who Count Backward is before midnight! I
        need to know!
      delay: 0
  questions:
  - questionId: QOPEN
    questionText: Let's start at the beginning, tell me exactly what happened.
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues: []
    grantedClues:
    - backstory
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: I was checking over the party invitation list earlier this evening, Every
        name was exactly how I'd wrote it... except one. 'Count Backward', at the
        bottom of the list.
      delay: 2.8
    - sender: 1
      text: I dismissed it at first, but one of my guests insists it is connected
        to an old legend, and I can't shake the feeling that something is terribly
        off about tonight.
      delay: 2.8
  - questionId: Q01E
    questionText: What do you know about 'Count Backward'?
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - backstory
    grantedClues:
    - the_diary
    response:
    - sender: 0
      text: All I know is that my housekeeper, Grace, found a diary mentioning it.
      delay: 0.8
  - questionId: Q02E
    questionText: What else can you tell me about this diary?
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - the_diary
    - backstory
    grantedClues:
    - evelyn_bryan_confrontation
    response:
    - sender: 0
      text: I didn't read it... well, I didn't read much of it, it is very weathered,
        but I did read something about 'Count Backward' mysteriously appearing on
        invitation lists, which is what first set off my fears, and suspicions.
      delay: 2.1
    - sender: 0
      text: I confronted Bryan about this, he has pranked me before and I suspected
        this was one of his childish attempts at getting a scare out of me, and to
        my utter expectation, I was correct, he planted the diary to scare me, I
        do not like that man.
      delay: 3.8
  - questionId: Q03E/A
    questionText: Alex seems to be withdrawing information from me, what do you think?
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - alexs_secrecy_2
    grantedClues:
    - richard_trusts_alex
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: 'Alex is a shy kid, he is 21, I doubt he knows anything.


        Alex
        is Richard''s apprentice at the textile factory, My husband can tell you
        more.'
      delay: 3.1
  - questionId: Q03E/B
    questionText: What came of your confrontation with Bryan?
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - backstory
    - the_diary
    - evelyn_bryan_confrontation
    grantedClues:
    - richard_bryan_relationship
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: He told me to give the diary back and to 'forget that I read anything'
      delay: 1.2
    - sender: 1
      text: I just scoffed at him and walked away, I don't know why he and Richard
        are still best friends.
      delay: 2.8
  - questionId: Q06E
    questionText: 'Why did you shut down the conversation about the diary with Grace?

'
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - the_diary
    - evelyn_shutdown_grace
    grantedClues:
    - richard_bryan_relationship
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: 'Because quite frankly my dear, it is none of her business. I just want
        everybody to have a good night.

'
      delay: 3.2
  - questionId: EV-10G
    questionText: What more can you tell me about Grace?
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - 10_more_information
    grantedClues: []
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: Grace has worked in the house for 11 years as our housekeeper, she cleans
        and ensures the house is in a suitable condition for us, she is very good
        at her job.
      delay: 2.841
  - questionId: EV-10R
    questionText: What more can you tell me about Richard?
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - 10_more_information
    grantedClues: []
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: 'I have been married to Richard for a long time, forty years, he inherited
        his family''s textile mill from his father 15 years ago, and he still runs
        it to this day.

'
      delay: 2.865
  - questionId: Q09E
    questionText: Who was present in the conversation? And what did Bryan mutter
      to himself?
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - the_big_bang
    grantedClues:
    - where_was_grace
    - where_did_alex_go_2
    - what_did_bryan_say
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: 'Richard was asking myself, Alex and Bryan about the missing watch. Alex
        seemed to have disappeared when the crash occurred, but he only left maybe
        a handful of seconds before the sound occurred.

'
      delay: 2.865
    - sender: 1
      text: I don't know what Bryan muttered, something about a clock perhaps?
      delay: 3.5
  - questionId: Q13E/A
    questionText: Why do you want the spare room cleared to read the diary in peace?
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - evelyns_secret_1
    grantedClues:
    - evelyns_secret_2
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: Because Richard thinks those old superstitions are nonsense. I didn't
        want him laughing at me.
      delay: 2.865
  - questionId: Q13E/B
    questionText: 'You said that you had only read a small amount of the diary? '
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - evelyns_secret_2
    grantedClues:
    - evelyns_secret_3
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: Yes... I'm sorry I have read more of it than I let on.
      delay: 2.865
  - questionId: Q13E/C
    questionText: Then why shut down Grace when she asked you about it? Why lie?
    askOnce: 1
    requiredClues:
    - evelyns_secret_3
    grantedClues:
    - evelyns_admission
    response:
    - sender: 1
      text: Because...
      delay: 3
    - sender: 1
      text: I wrote the name on the invite list, I admit it.
      delay: 4
    - sender: 1
      text: I have been obsessing over the diary, and had to prove it wrong to myself,
        but Bryan convinced me the diary is real, and that is why I had to contact
        you.
      delay: 1
